#: ../../tools/eva_tools.rst:106 3c4f2407eb1f4ba19f340b7e75943dd0
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all variant studies available in the European "
"Variation Archive (EVA) for a given species. Returns study accessions "
"(e.g., PRJEB84021) that have submitted variant data. Useful for "
"discovering available datasets before querying variants. Each study "
"typically corresponds to a population sequencing project or variant "
"calling pipeline."
